"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nThis is an interior-focused cafe with a striking concept.  \nHowever, the details are a bit disappointing compared to the overall concept.  \nIf they were going for a specific theme, they could have pushed it even further.  \n\nBeing a large cafe, there's plenty of seating, making it a good place to relax.  \n\nThey offer lunch menus which tasted decent, though the value for money isn't great.\n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"